type: txt
help: Maximum number of values in a memory buffer (default: 100)
val_help: u32:2-65535; Maximum number of values in a memory buffer
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value  --exec \"${vyos_validators_dir}/numeric --range 2-65535\"  --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "Buffer-size must be between 2 and 65535"
